flowchart LR
  FRED[Factor / macro ingestion] --> PANEL[Normalized factor panel]
  XLSX[(Brokerage workbook)] --> ING[Ingest holdings]
  ING --> HOLD[Normalized holdings]
  HOLD --> PRICES[Price history and returns]
  PANEL --> BENCH[Policy benchmark\nexplicit identity: FF5 Mkt-RF/RMW]
  PRICES --> BENCH
  BENCH --> OPT[Tax-aware optimization]
  OPT --> TE[Tracking error branch\nfactor covariance + residual risk]
  OPT --> CVAR[CVaR branch\noverlapping 12-month scenarios]
  TE --> ATTR[Risk attribution]
  CVAR --> ATTR
  ATTR --> REPORT[Rebalance report / dashboard]
  PANEL -.-> DEMO[Demo TE prototype\nsynthetic only]
  PRICES -.-> COLLAR[Collar what-if analysis\nscenario reuse]
  DEMO -.-> REPORT
  COLLAR -.-> REPORT
